      "search:sku": "005V-06257",
      "search:title": "Sandfly Fever Naples Virus (strain Yu_WHO 4/25-1)",
      "search:description": "The virus was isolated in a suckling mouse from a sandfly sample SP67/BF collected in Kosovo. The homogenate of mouse brain (WHO 4/25-1) was inoculated into the HuH-7 cell culture. The product is an infectious cell culture supernatant. The Sandfly Fever Naples virus (strain Yu) is preserved in Viral Storage Medium at -80°C. The virus is confirmed to be free of mycoplasma. Its identity was confirmed by sequencing.",
