      "dcterms:description": "The lyophilized, non infectious, encapsidated RNA (Armored RNA) contains the sequence of  Nucleocapsid in the segment S from Toscana virus and can be used as positive control for extraction and real time RT-PCR using specific Primers and probe ref: 001K-06008. \r\nExtraction is mandatory before use in real time RT-PCR. \r\nPackaged for 100 Rxns, for RUO (Research Use Only). \r\nSOPs in the attached pdf.",
