      "search:sku": "014V-05969",
      "search:title": "Oropouche virus, human, strain RIVM/OROV/TRVL9760/09/11/1967",
      "search:description": "Original strain TRVL9760 was maintained through passage by intracerebral mouse inoculation. Total 9 passages. Inoculated mouse tissue was used to infect Vero cells. Virus stock is P2 on Vero cells. \r\nVirus was part of old virus collection at RIVM.",
