      "dcterms:title": "HIV-1 pNL-BX_pr-InsAAT(Asn)-at25",
      "dcterms:description": "full length plasmid clone of proviral HIV-1; construct produces HIV-1 proteins upon transfection into eukaryotic cells but is non-infectious due to a protease-inactivating mutation in the catalytic centre of the protein (D25N); virus is based on NL-BX",
