      "EVORAO:preparationTechnique": "solid phase column extraction",
      "EVORAO:observedMutations": "mutation as indicated in the name; backbone is NL-BX:\r\nThe virus genome is derived from pNL-NF (pNL4-3 with shortened cellular flank) (doi.org/10.1016/j.jcv.2006.05.001), after introduction of a unique BamHI site 5’ (ggagcc2207ggaTcc; A->S in Pol; E->D in Gag) and an XmaI site 3’ (ccagga2589ccCggG; silent in Env; L->S in Rev) from the protease gene, respectively. The original BamHI site as position 8465 was removed (GGATCC->GGATCA change).\r\nThe inserted Asn codon at position 25 of protease renders the virus protease-defective",
