      "search:sku": "021V-05620",
      "search:title": "Bovine adenovirus A, WBR50",
      "search:description": "Freeze-dried Bovine adenovirus A, strain WBR50. Has been extracted and identified through WGS. Freeze dried in 1985 and stored in old-style glass vial. Viability last checked in 1989. Could be used for RNA studies.",
