      "search:title": "SARS-CoV-2 strain Slovakia/SK-BMC-KR54/2021- B.1.160 variant",
      "search:description": "This SARS-CoV-2 strain was isolated from a COVID-19 patient from Slovakia in January 2021. The virus belongs to the B.1.160 lineage. The virus is preserved in Viral Storage Medium (-80 °C). Tests for the presence of mycoplasma were negative. To confirm its identity, the virus has been fully sequenced.",
