      "search:sku": "006V-05596",
      "search:title": "SARS-CoV-2 strain Slovakia/SK-BMC-KR43/2021- B.1.258 variant ",
      "search:description": "This SARS-CoV-2 strain was isolated from a COVID-19 patient from Slovakia in January 2021. The virus belongs to the B.1.258 lineage. The virus is preserved in Viral Storage Medium (-80 °C). Tests for the presence of mycoplasma were negative. To confirm its identity, the virus has been fully sequenced.",
