      "dcterms:description": "This SARS-CoV-2 strain was isolated from a COVID-19 patient from Slovakia in March 2023. The virus belongs to the XBB.1.5 lineage (Omicron VOC). The virus is preserved in Viral Storage Medium (-80 °C). Tests for the presence of mycoplasma were negative. To confirm its identity, the virus has been fully sequenced.",
