      "dcterms:description": "This SARS-CoV-2 strain was isolated from a COVID-19 patient from Slovakia in February 2023. The virus belongs to the BQ.1.1.10 lineage (alias of B.1.1.529.5.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.10; Omicron VOC). The virus is  preserved under Viral Storage Medium -80C. Tests for the presence of mycoplasmae were negative. To confirm its identity the virus has been fully sequenced.",
